ccuracy matter\n- Progress-based competition - keep up to stay in the action\n- 100+ obby maps with increasing difficulty\n- Earn coins and customise your character\n- Leaderboards - track progress and show your skills\n\nInvite your friends, enter the tournament, and see who rises to the top.","path":"/game/712717349-obby-king-remastered","slug":"712717349-obby-king-remastered","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aca450f9cedff43fd4ace77723f3316b286655c35e7b85893a5c2f92a5dcec62.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0144636a68ff59332c41d79b135bc635/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":59758268,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-30T19:48:28.849Z","creator":{"name":"Obby King Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":583507031,"name":"PAPERS, PLEASE! [❗UPDATE]","desc":"🌿💼 𝐖𝐄𝐋𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐄 𝐓𝐎 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐆𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐍 𝐅𝐄𝐃𝐄𝐑𝐀𝐋 𝐁𝐎𝐑𝐃𝐄𝐑!\nYour objective is to cross the heavily guarded border checkpoint - alive. Immigrate using your personal documents or attempt to sneak past the Border Guards. Or, rebel against the regime and fight back with EZIC to reclaim territory.\nReady to cross the line? Play now & shape your life.\n\nPapers, Please is a roleplay game where players attempt to immigrate into the fictional city of Grestin. Cross the imperialist fortress and work a job to get paid, or live a life of crime - sneak past border guards & steal from stores to make a living; it's up to you. Inspired by Lucas Pope's \"Papers Please\".\n\n💣 Purchase bundles and save on weapons and tools in-game: https://www.roblox.com/games/12349604659\n⚔️ Join the Military and begin your career in the Federation: https://www.roblox.com/groups/3029096\n📜 Stay up to date with game rules and guidelines: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/-/4174028","path":"/game/583507031-papers-please","slug":"583507031-papers-please","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7b3c81bfaad9e1793bb61b93c285996be3d76ff957253ac4506b4d807f4dcd01.webp","o